WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:15.280
Radio: Police are still on the lookout for what sources are calling: The Uberkiller.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.960
The serial murderer uses the popular rideshare service

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.820
to isolate victims.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.160
Authorities are encouraging extreme caution when using the ride-share application.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.640
You call for an Ubar?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.020
Yep. Can you help me with my bag?

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.580
You need help with that little thing?

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:33.500
So whatcha got in that little bag of yours anyways?

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:37.020
Oh... not much... just some clothes.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:43.400
I was hoping to have room for some souvenirs on the way back.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:46.220
What?

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:50.060
Nothing. Nothing...

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:07.280
You can actually go straight here.

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:09.740
Don't worry hun. I know a shortcut.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.440
I... I need to get out.

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.180
Relax sweetheart.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:28.160
Really?

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.200
Just pull over!

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:33.560
As you wish..

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.180
*1930s Jazz Music*

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:51.980
*screaming*

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:53.740
*gagging*

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:28.900
Radio: Authorities are encouraging extreme caution for drivers using the service in the area.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.720
Especially in the late hours of the night.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.720
They also recommend working with a buddy.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.000
Remember...

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.980
The Uberkiller...

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.240
Could be anyone.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.020
Thanks for watching Uberhorror.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:50.840
We were wondering. When you ride in these things, do you usually sit in the front or the back?

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:52.260
Let us know in the comments.

